683 - Jesus, Stand Among Us
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 683
Topic: Sentences and Responses - 

Verse 1:
[F/C]Jesus, [C]stand among [F/A]us
[Dm/A]In Thy risen [C]power;
[C]Let [Am]this [Bb]time [C7]of [F/C]worship
[F/C]Be a [Gm/D]hallowed [Dm/A]hour.

Verse 2:
[F/C]Breathe the [C]Holy [Dm/A]Spirit
[Dm/A]Into every [F/C]heart;
[C]Bid [Am]the [Bb]fears [C7]and [F/C]sorrows
[F/C]From each [Gm/D]soul [C]depart.

Verse 3:
